Cell["\<\
The original energy reference and plot ranges are retained. The original \
parameters give Gamma-point gaps of approximately 16.67 meV for 4QL and 2.04 \
meV for 8QL.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f88ba2c-30f9-3746-acef-35892fd6f1d9"]
}, Open  ]],

