Cell["\<\
Store the averaged spectrum for -5 to 5 degrees and display the central \
enlargement for S12(c), using xindex and Yindex from the original white box.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fa284e57-9a36-8842-a50c-519f717c6614"],

